<question type="stack">
  <name><text>Adding a dearer grade for a profit</text></name>
  <questiontext format="html">
    <text><![CDATA[<p>A shopkeeper has \({@m@}\) kg of ordinary rice that cost Ksh \({@p1@}\) a kilogram and adds pishori rice that cost Ksh \({@p2@}\) a kilogram. The mixture is sold at Ksh \({@s@}\) a kilogram, a profit of \({@dd(r)@}\%\) on the cost.</p><p>(a) What did 1 kg of the mixture cost the shopkeeper?</p><p>Ksh [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</p><p>(b) How many kilograms of pishori rice were added? Give your answer exactly or correct to 1 decimal place.</p><p>[[input:ans2]] kg [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</p>]]></text>
  </questiontext>
  <generalfeedback format="html">
    <text><![CDATA[<p>(a) Profit is a percentage of the cost price: selling price \(=\) cost \(\times {@dd(mf)@}\). So the cost of 1 kg is \({@s@} \div {@dd(mf)@} = {@cc@}\) shillings.</p><p>(b) Let \(x\) kg of pishori be added. Each kilogram of ordinary rice is \({@cc@} - {@p1@} = {@cc-p1@}\) shillings below the mixture's cost and each kilogram of pishori is \({@p2@} - {@cc@} = {@p2-cc@}\) shillings above it, so</p><p>\[{@m@} \times {@cc-p1@} = x \times {@p2-cc@}, \qquad x = \frac{ {@m*(cc-p1)@} }{ {@p2-cc@} } = {@dd(xx)@}\]</p><p>Check: \(({@m@} \times {@p1@} + {@dd(xx)@} \times {@p2@}) \div {@dd(m+xx)@} = {@cc@}\), and \({@cc@} \times {@dd(mf)@} = {@s@}\).</p>]]></text>
  </generalfeedback>
  <defaultgrade>2</defaultgrade>
  <penalty>0.1</penalty>
  <hidden>0</hidden>
  <idnumber></idnumber>
  <stackversion><text>2026063000</text></stackversion>
  <questionvariables>
    <text><![CDATA[kgrp(n) := block([s, out, k], s: string(n), k: slength(s), if k < 5 then s else (out: "", while k > 3 do (out: sconcat("\\,", substring(s, k-2, k+1), out), k: k-3), sconcat(substring(s, 1, k+1), out)));
ksh(v) := block([c, w, f], c: floor(100*v+1/2), w: floor(c/100), f: c-100*w, if f = 0 then kgrp(w) else sconcat(kgrp(w), ".", if f < 10 then "0" else "", string(f)));
dd(v) := if integerp(v) then v else if integerp(10*v) then dispdp(float(v),1) else if integerp(100*v) then dispdp(float(v),2) else if integerp(1000*v) then dispdp(float(v),3) else dispdp(float(v),4);
fr(v) := if integerp(v) then string(v) else sconcat("\\frac{", string(num(v)), "}{", string(denom(v)), "}");
r1(v) := floor(10*v+1/2)/10;
ix: 1+rand(10);
/* Design: how much dearer rice to add for a given profit. Source: original. [m, p1, p2, s, r]: m kg of ordinary rice at p1, pishori at p2, selling price s a kg for r% profit on cost. Curated list, one seed per entry. */
L: [[28,145,265,234,20],[24,165,275,230,15],[56,145,240,187,10],[36,140,235,184,15],[48,165,280,275,25],[20,140,240,234,25/2],[44,130,240,228,20],[60,120,240,184,15],[56,140,195,180,25/2],[28,135,255,207,15]];
E: L[ix];
m: E[1]; p1: E[2]; p2: E[3]; s: E[4]; r: E[5];
cc: s/(1+r/100);
xx: m*(cc-p1)/(p2-cc);
mf: 1+r/100;
/* diagnostics */
sr: s*(1-r/100);
smr: s-r;
swx: m*(p2-cc)/(cc-p1);
usx: m*(s-p1)/(p2-s);
tot: m+xx;
ftsr: m*(sr-p1)/(p2-sr);
]]></text>
  </questionvariables>
